From e0f95a3fc2d7dc8b1e2b4250095bc55ec7a8c316 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 21:10:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 283/288] reaper v2.0.5: Hardware QoS Diagnostics page
 (Reaper_QoSDiag.asp) - live per-queue occupancy/drops/estimated-delay +
 scheduler from the Runner/XRDP egress_tm read via bdmf-shell; new auth-gated
 do_reaper_qdiag.cgi JSON feed; Traffic Manager menu tab right of QoS;
 open-only fast polling (250-500ms), adapts to qos_type 10 (single PI2) / 11
 (classful)

